    "excerpt": "Venus and Spica finally have their conjunction just as they sink way down in twilight. After dark, Boötes and the Big Dipper have assumed their late-summer pose. The post This Week's Sky at a Glance, August 28, September 6 appeared first.",
    "excerpt_pt": "Venus and Spica finally have their conjunction just as they sink way down in twilight. After dark, Boötes and the Big Dipper have assumed their late-summer pose. The post This Week's Sky at a Glance, August 28, September 6 appeared first.",
